      "result": "## Test Completion Summary\n\nI have successfully completed the comprehensive QA validation of the Technical Specifications Knowledge Base application. **All 16 test items PASSED**.\n\n### Test Results Overview:\n\n**Functionality Tests (10/10 PASSED)**\n- **FT-1**: Module filtering works perfectly - clicking module buttons filters documents, \"All\" restores complete list\n- **FT-2**: Document display shows all required information (title, description, module badge, version, update date, sections, related docs)\n- **FT-3**: Document references are navigable - clicking reference links successfully opens referenced documents\n- **FT-4**: Content sections can be collapsed - hiding body and reference links while maintaining accessibility\n- **FT-5**: Content sections can be expanded - restoring content and reference links with visual indicators\n- **FT-6**: Knowledge graph has functional zoom controls (Zoom In/Out, Reset View) with zoom level feedback\n- **FT-7**: Knowledge graph represents all available documents with proper module associations and relationships\n- **FT-8**: Three distinct views available and functional (Documents, Knowledge Graph, Favorites)\n- **FT-9**: Tab switching preserves state - selected document persists, section expansion states maintained, graph zoom preserved\n- **FT-10**: Favorites system fully functional - local storage with real-time count updates, persistent markers across filters\n\n**Constraint Tests (2/2 PASSED)**\n- **CS-12**: No document lists itself as a reference - Component Library and other documents properly reference only related documents\n- **CS-13**: Knowledge graph properly structured - one node per document, module associations in legend, connections for relationships\n\n**Interaction Tests (4/4 PASSED)**\n- **IX-15**: Visual collapse/expand indicators present - section buttons show state with [active] attributes and content visibility\n- **IX-16**: Graph nodes open documents - clicking document nodes selects them in document view without requiring tab change\n- **IX-17**: Collapsed section protection - clicking reference links in collapsed sections shows helpful prompt: \"Please expand the section to access links\"\n- **IX-18**: No-results feedback - searching for non-existent documents displays \"No documents found\" with helpful suggestion\n\n### Application Features Validated:\n✅ Module-based document organization and filtering\n✅ Comprehensive document metadata display\n✅ Collapsible/expandable content sections\n✅ Document relationship navigation\n✅ Interactive knowledge graph with zoom controls\n✅ Multi-view interface (Documents, Knowledge Graph, Favorites)\n✅ Cross-tab state persistence\n✅ Local storage for favorites with real-time updates\n✅ User-friendly prompts for workflow guidance\n✅ Appropriate messaging for edge cases\n\nThe technical specifications knowledge base application meets all specified requirements and demonstrates robust functionality for browsing, navigating, and managing technical documentation.",
